;; The dossier kit's host edits its file live through Omega (omega.live-doc):
;; one watched shared buffer per real file, and an in-place block editor.
;; Only serve.bl requires Omega; the rendering namespaces (rendering.bundle.bl)
;; never do, so projects importing that bundle need nothing more.
;;
;; The released `bl` that runs dossier services predates :source/imports, so
;; Omega arrives as a library root. When a release ships source imports, pin
;; ~/projects/omega/live-doc.bundle.bl by hash instead (see Omega's
;; docs/live-doc.bl.org).
{:name "bl-org-dossier-kit"
 :paths ["." "~/projects/omega/src"]}
